We have developed custom scripts to quantify specific mice behaviors in our lab. Instructions to run them are as follows:
1. Download DeepLabCut. Instructions can be found here: [text](https://deeplabcut.github.io/DeepLabCut/docs/installation.html)
2. Download Python. 
3. Run DeepLabCut. Instructions can be found here: [text](https://deeplabcut.github.io/DeepLabCut/docs/standardDeepLabCut_UserGuide.html)
4. Use our scripts to analyze behavior. Scripts in the "By_Bouts" folder measure bouts of behavior throughout the videos. Scripts in the "By_Time folder measure amount of time that the behavior is present throughout the videos. 